sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Lecturer
    participant API as FRMS Booking API
    participant Validator as Conflict Validator
    actor Approver as Dean / HOD
    participant Notify as Notification Service
    participant Audit as Audit Log

    Lecturer->>API: Submit booking request
    API->>Validator: Validate request
    Validator->>Validator: Check timetable, bookings, blackouts and capacity

    alt Conflict detected
        Validator-->>API: Conflict details
        API-->>Lecturer: Reject request with reason
    else Request valid
        Validator-->>API: Request validated
        API->>Approver: Route request for approval
        Approver->>API: Submit approval decision
        API->>Audit: Record decision and approver
        API->>Notify: Send decision notification
        Notify-->>Lecturer: Deliver outcome
    end
